strogens, baby Pulp pulp from maca root, fenugreek, and ashwagandha These plants contain compounds that mimic your natural estrogen And estrogen is the hormone that decides where a woman's body stores It's way your hips, your thighs, your booty Phytostrogens don't move anything They signal, they tell your body store it here, not there Your body listens, and I think that's the most beautiful thing anyone ever said about a plant Top hormone specialists were charging $800 a session to prescribe this Then doctors had this idea What if we took the same high-potency phytostrogens compounds And concentrated them into a single daily vital drop? Same ingredient, no needle, no gym, no surgery Just you and a little bottle every morning The moment it hits your system, your estrogen receptors wake up And start signaling your body to send fat to your booty And here's the part that gets me every time Women who never had curves their whole life Within weeks, their genes stop buttoning past their thighs They're saying genes that used to slide right over their hips That's not fat being forced somewhere it doesn't belong That's your body finally storing weight where it was always meant to go Your body builds the curves itself and the results don't disappear when you stop Because the change already happened from the inside Women start seeing changes in as little as 90 days A more vital drops are currently 67% off But it won't last long So stock up while you can 90-day money back guarantee, no questions asked If you're still seeing the link below, they're still stock Grab yours before this batch sells out Down, down, down, down","callToAction":"SHOP NOW","landingPageUrl":"https://shopamua.com/products/amua-vitaldrops","landingPageDomain":"shopamua.com","ctaDescription":"Embrace your curves, naturally","ctaLinkDescription":null},"metrics":{"reach":5858,"aggregatedReach":null,"estimatedSpend":53,"duplicates":7,"reachDelta1d":null,"reachDelta7d":null,"reachDelta30d":null},"audience":{"targ